notes.content:
While many of you were already enjoying the new features, here's the full list of changes included in version 0.0.60:

Bugfixes:

@Piero: Fixed Italian translations

@Alberto: UI adjustments and fixes

Staff and offers reset properly after resigning

@Foni: Fixed creation/modification date conflicts in databases

@TONI: Fixed tactics issue in last league match

@TONI: Sales now correctly added to club funds

New Features:

@Kim Ross: Player search by name

Cup notifications added

Save game deletion now asks for confirmation

@Balaguer: Calendar now shows played match results

@eboke: Cancel search option for players or youth

@eboke: Secretary added as shortcut in main menu

@eboke: Kit number changes restricted to pre-season

@eboke: National cup results added to results screen

Thanks for your support and feedback — more to come soon!

📢 Update 0.0.59 is live!



🛠️ Bug Fixes

@nokenny49: Fixed issue with end-of-season objectives

Match booking system rebalanced

@nokenny49 + @jkrilin: Overhaul of league table system and its calculation

@Foni + @Balaguer + @jkrilin: Minor UI tweaks

@Balaguer: Language selector adjustments

✨ New Features

@David19dh: Changelog now shown on game launch (with welcome message)

Auto-save disabled by default for better performance

Mid-match tactical changes now allowed

Brand new Scouting Department added! 🔍 Search for players based on selected criteria – more filters will be added soon!

🙏 Thanks for your continued support!

We start the week by fixing several bugs reported over the weekend. Thanks everyone for the feedback! 🙌


@Nokenny49: Fixed issue with young players deciding to retire in later seasons.
@Raúl Almedia + @Alan Wake + Several others: Fixed annoying screen vibration caused by tables.
@Foni: Reviewed Spanish translations.
@Alberto: When signing a player, if they were in the shortlist, they are now removed from it.
@Alberto + @Iñaki Sainz: Fixed issue preventing certain matches from being completed.


More improvements coming soon thanks to your support! ⚽

🎉 Hello everyone!  
I'm pleased to present version v0.0.55-dev, which includes some small fixes (some already live) before we bring the next update featuring the National Cup.  
Many thanks to the community and to those who have streamed Pro Football live recently!

🛠️ Bugfixes:

@nokenny49 Fixed player retirement logic — now based on morale and form.
Suspended matches are now more clearly marked.
@MageC Added tooltips to Manager and Pro Manager mode buttons.
@David Player position added as tooltip in the transfer list.
@Alan Wake Fixed matchday navigation in the results window.
@Alberto Added match info when clicking days on the calendar.
@eboke Fixed "Offer to Club" appearing during renewals.
@eboke Added confirmation before releasing players.
@eboke Navigation from notifications to relevant sections.
@eboke Reworked card design to look better.


🆕 Feature:

First version of the player leaderboard showing furthest progress in a career. Congrats Nokenny! 😄
